# Damping Sphere: each spell a player casts costs {1} more for each OTHER spell that player has cast this turn (CR 601.2f).
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts three Moxen. Turn 3 Bot1 casts Mox Pearl (the first spell this turn: no tax, though three were cast on
# turn 1) and Damping Sphere (the second, paid with two Moxen; a spell cast before the Sphere arrived counts), then Mox
# Sapphire as the third spell: {2} more, paid with exactly two Moxen. On turn 4 Bot2 casts Mox Jet (free), Mox Ruby ({1} more)
# and Mox Emerald ({2} more), each paid exactly; Bot1's Brainstorm cast in between costs only {U} - Bot2's spells are
# not Bot1's. Each pool is checked right after the cast, in the same step.

